To check whether query.py exists, run:

Shell
ls chroma_db_code

Expected output:

Plain Text
__init__.py
ingest.py
query.py

If query.py is present, view its contents:

Shell
cat chroma_db_code/query.py

or

Shell
nano chroma_db_code/query.py

To check what was stored in ChromaDB:

Shell
ls -la chroma_db_storage

You should see files and folders created by ChromaDB.

To verify your documents are still present:

Shell
ls -la documents

Expected:

Plain Text
doc1_cibil_rule.txt
doc2_loan_policy.txt
Quick Verification Commands

Run these one by one:

Shell
pwd

Should show:

Plain Text
/root/my-loan-project
Shell
